    <briefdescription>
<para>The <computeroutput>effects</computeroutput> list of one series. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Redraws the series when an effect changes, refreshes the effects once per frame, and warns about effects the series ignores: unsupported ones and repeated types. Warnings wait for the series&apos; component to complete, so they can name it by its <computeroutput>objectName</computeroutput>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
